# Grasse and Raquette river towns inland: Canton, Potsdam, Madrid, Norfolk, Massena, Lisbon, Morley, Colton). Drawn at
# random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region nny, which had 18 places, all in Jefferson County). The Atlas had nothing
# within 40 km of Waddington. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py); HMdb marker pages
# and nearby lists, the Ogdensburg Harbor Lighthouse Register form (16000202), the 2026 Waddington Historic District
# boundary-increase form (NYS Parks State Review Board, September 2026), the Fort La Presentation Association, Grasse
# River Heritage, the Remington Museum of Art, the Potsdam Public Museum, the Episcopal Diocese of Albany, the Town of
# Lisbon, morristown-ny.com, LighthouseFriends, Gribblenation, Bridgemeister and the HistoricBridges copy of the National
# Bridge Inventory sheet, all through tools/page.py. Most older Register forms for this county are NPGallery placeholders
# and were not read.
